  "worked_solution": "To find the $y$-intercept, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-5{e}^{-(0)^{3}}+3 \\\\  & =-5{e}^{0}+3 \\\\  & =-5(1)+3 \\\\  & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $y$-intercept is $-2.$",
